  <h1>About Logan Vestal</h1>
  <p>
    Logan Vestal is an emerging artist based in Arizona, part of a new generation of
    creatives sharing original work and building an audience one piece at a time — right
    here, online, rather than through a traditional gallery circuit.
  </p>
  <p>
    Her work spans painting and drawing, exploring color, character, and everyday moments.
    Every piece in the gallery is original and uploaded directly by Logan.
  </p>
  <p>
    When she's not creating, Logan can usually be found reading up on her favorite animal —
    the giant panda — or out enjoying everything Arizona has to offer, from desert sunsets
    to the local art scene.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href="/">Browse the gallery</a> to see her latest work — new pieces are added regularly.
  </p>
